WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.501
Wukong put his hand on the iron pillar.

2
00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:21.022
He felt it move.

3
00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:23.422
"Hmm," he thought.

4
00:00:23.442 --> 00:00:26.183
"This piece of iron really is magical.

5
00:00:27.063 --> 00:00:28.744
I bet it will do whatever I want it to do."

6
00:00:30.148 --> 00:00:31.949
"Smaller!" commanded Wukong.

7
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:33.910
pillar shrank!

8
00:00:34.911 --> 00:00:37.272
Soon it was just a little taller than Wukong.

9
00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:43.455
He picked it up and swung it around.

10
00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:47.938
"This is a perfect weapon for me," he said.

11
00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:51.600
"I can't believe he can lift it!"

12
00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.080
said the Dragon Queen.

13
00:00:54.181 --> 00:00:56.342
Wukong made the bar even smaller.

14
00:00:58.043 --> 00:00:59.624
it was no bigger than a pin.

15
00:01:00.556 --> 00:01:04.017
He placed it inside his ear.

16
00:01:06.138 --> 00:01:08.038
"I've got what I want," said Wukong.

17
00:01:08.058 --> 00:01:11.960
"Good-bye." He turned around and left.

18
00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:18.242
"He was very rude," said the Dragon Queen.

19
00:01:19.402 --> 00:01:21.603
The Dragon King clenched his fists.

20
00:01:22.463 --> 00:01:25.124
"I'm going to report him to the Jade Emperor!"

21
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.623
Back home, the others were amazed by Wukong's new weapon.

22
00:01:33.643 --> 00:01:37.645
"Nobody will ever attack us again!"

23
00:01:38.046 --> 00:01:39.046
declared Wukong.

24
00:01:40.387 --> 00:01:41.768
The monkeys and apes cheered.

25
00:01:43.109 --> 00:01:46.191
They held a big feast that lasted until late at night.

26
00:01:51.574 --> 00:01:52.815
went to bed happy.

27
00:01:56.178 --> 00:02:01.040
But as he fell asleep, two spirits grabbed him.

28
00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:02.121
are you doing?"

29
00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:03.242
asked Wukong.

30
00:02:03.262 --> 00:02:04.983
"Let go of me!"

31
00:02:11.849 --> 00:02:15.412
He kicked and struggled as the spirits dragged him out of his cave.

32
00:02:17.474 --> 00:02:19.656
They walked toward a dark and creepy city.

33
00:02:20.657 --> 00:02:24.120
A sign on the entrance gate said "Land of Darkness."

34
00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.423
"The Land of Darkness?"

35
00:02:27.763 --> 00:02:28.604
cried Wukong.

36
00:02:29.832 --> 00:02:31.293
where people go when they die.

37
00:02:32.374 --> 00:02:33.715
I'm supposed to live forever!"

38
00:02:37.338 --> 00:02:38.658
yanked his arms free.

39
00:02:38.678 --> 00:02:41.380
"Grow!" he cried.

40
00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:44.222
iron bar quickly grew.

41
00:02:46.944 --> 00:02:48.325
He knocked out the first spirit.

42
00:02:51.527 --> 00:02:53.088
He knocked out the second spirit.

43
00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.932
Wukong stomped into the Land of Darkness.

44
00:03:00.736 --> 00:03:02.938
He headed toward the Palace of Darkness.

45
00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:09.362
he went, he swung his iron bar back and forth.

46
00:03:10.343 --> 00:03:12.084
Demons and ghosts fled.

47
00:03:14.186 --> 00:03:17.088
A tall spirit stepped out of the palace.

48
00:03:18.469 --> 00:03:19.950
"What's going on out here?"

49
00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.071
the spirit asked.

50
00:03:21.091 --> 00:03:22.532
"Who are you?"

51
00:03:22.952 --> 00:03:23.713
asked Wukong.

52
00:03:23.733 --> 00:03:27.976
"I am the Judge of the Dead," said the spirit.

53
00:03:28.848 --> 00:03:30.990
"Why are you causing all this trouble?"

54
00:03:32.391 --> 00:03:34.913
want to know why I was brought here," said Wukong.

55
00:03:34.933 --> 00:03:36.774
"Tell me now!"

56
00:03:37.855 --> 00:03:39.496
The judge held up his hands.

57
00:03:39.516 --> 00:03:44.620
"If you were brought here, it means your time on Earth is over."

58
00:03:45.641 --> 00:03:47.522
"Nonsense!" yelled Wukong.

59
00:03:47.542 --> 00:03:49.544
"I'm going to live forever!"

60
00:03:50.785 --> 00:03:51.825
judge looked nervous.

61
00:03:51.845 --> 00:03:55.920
"Let's check the Directory," he said.

62
00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:59.681
"The Directory contains the name and age of every creature on Earth.

63
00:04:01.222 --> 00:04:03.582
It says when each creature will die."

64
00:04:05.823 --> 00:04:09.004
Inside the palace the judge opened a large book.

65
00:04:09.024 --> 00:04:11.725
"What is your name?"

66
00:04:12.005 --> 00:04:12.505
he asked.

67
00:04:13.705 --> 00:04:14.185
told him.

68
00:04:15.306 --> 00:04:16.746
The judge flipped through the pages.

69
00:04:18.107 --> 00:04:19.307
it is," said the judge.

70
00:04:19.327 --> 00:04:23.408
"It says 'Sun Wukong.

71
00:04:23.468 --> 00:04:25.670
Born from a stone three hundred years ago.

72
00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:27.772
Died today.'"

73
00:04:30.454 --> 00:04:31.115
shook his head.

74
00:04:31.135 --> 00:04:33.957
"No. I'm going to live forever."

75
00:04:34.998 --> 00:04:37.740
"The Directory isn't wrong," said the judge.

76
00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.202
"You'll have to stay here now."

77
00:04:44.186 --> 00:04:47.208
raised his iron bar and glared at the judge.

78
00:04:47.228 --> 00:04:49.370
"Give me that book!"

79
00:04:50.811 --> 00:04:51.732
judge hesitated.

80
00:04:52.372 --> 00:04:55.033
"I can't give it "Now!"

81
00:04:55.373 --> 00:04:56.133
said Wukong.

82
00:04:57.253 --> 00:05:00.054
Shaking, the judge handed the book to Wukong.

83
00:05:03.075 --> 00:05:05.756
Wukong plucked two of his hairs and blew on them.

84
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:09.357
turned into a brush and a jar of ink.

85
00:05:10.957 --> 00:05:12.898
He drew a line through his name.

86
00:05:14.418 --> 00:05:15.738
"You can't do that!"

87
00:05:16.018 --> 00:05:16.639
said the judge.

88
00:05:16.659 --> 00:05:19.979
"Yes, I can," said Wukong.

89
00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:24.807
Next, Wukong found the names of all the other monkeys and apes.

90
00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:30.611
He crossed out their names too.

91
00:05:34.995 --> 00:05:37.738
I really will live forever," said Wukong.

92
00:05:37.758 --> 00:05:40.300
"And so will all of my subjects!"
